msgid "Credential:"
msgstr "Kredenzjali:"

msgid ""
"No saved credentials yet. Tick \"Save password\" when you are asked for the "
"password, or create one in Tools > Credentials Manager."
msgstr "Għad m'hemm l-ebda kredenzjali ssejvjata. Immarka \"Issejvja l-password\" meta tintalab il-password, jew oħloq waħda f'Għodod > Maniġer tal-Kredenzjali."

msgid ""
"OpenCRT answers the host's first login and password prompts with this "
"credential, unless you start typing first. Manage credentials in Tools > "
"Credentials Manager."
msgstr "OpenCRT iwieġeb l-ewwel prompts tal-login u tal-password tal-host b'din il-kredenzjali, sakemm ma tibdiex tittajpja int l-ewwel. Immaniġġja l-kredenzjali f'Għodod > Maniġer tal-Kredenzjali."

msgid ""
"The username (if the credential has one) and the saved password come from "
"this credential. Manage credentials in Tools > Credentials Manager."
msgstr "L-isem tal-utent (jekk il-kredenzjali għandha wieħed) u l-password issejvjata jiġu minn din il-kredenzjali. Immaniġġja l-kredenzjali f'Għodod > Maniġer tal-Kredenzjali."

msgid "Private key file:"
msgstr "Fajl taċ-ċavetta privata:"

msgid "blank to use password authentication"
msgstr "vojt biex tuża awtentikazzjoni bil-password"

msgid "Certificate:"
msgstr "Ċertifikat:"

msgid "optional; <key file>-cert.pub is used if it exists"
msgstr "fakultattiv; <fajl taċ-ċavetta>-cert.pub jintuża jekk jeżisti"

msgid ""
"Allow legacy algorithms (SHA-1 key exchange, CBC ciphers) for old devices"
msgstr "Ippermetti algoritmi antiki (skambju taċ-ċwievet SHA-1, ċifri CBC) għal apparati qodma"

msgid "Enable compression (for slow links)"
msgstr "Attiva l-kompressjoni (għal konnessjonijiet bil-mod)"

msgid "Forward the SSH agent (only to hosts you trust)"
msgstr "Għaddi l-aġent SSH (lil hosts li tafdahom biss)"

msgid ""
"Order tried: public key (the key file if set, otherwise keys in a running "
"SSH agent such as Pageant), then keyboard-interactive or password. Passwords "
"are only saved in a credential, in the system keychain; otherwise you are "
"asked for them when needed."
msgstr "Ordni tat-tentattivi: ċavetta pubblika (il-fajl taċ-ċavetta jekk issettjat, inkella ċ-ċwievet f'aġent SSH li qed jaħdem bħal Pageant), imbagħad keyboard-interactive jew password. Il-passwords jiġu ssejvjati biss f'kredenzjali, fil-keychain tas-sistema; inkella jintalbu meta jkun hemm bżonn."

