msgstr "vojt biex ma jsirx log"

msgid "Start each line with the date and time"
msgstr "Ibda kull linja bid-data u l-ħin"

msgid ""
"Also keep a raw log (.raw beside it): the bytes as received, escape "
"sequences included"
msgstr "Żomm ukoll log mhux ipproċessat (.raw ħdejh): il-bytes kif waslu, inklużi s-sekwenzi ta' escape"

msgid "On connect:"
msgstr "Mal-konnessjoni:"

msgid "e.g. === %S connected %Y-%M-%D %h:%m:%s ==="
msgstr "eż. === %S ikkonnettjat %Y-%M-%D %h:%m:%s ==="

msgid "On disconnect:"
msgstr "Mal-iskonnettjar:"

msgid "Each line:"
msgstr "Kull linja:"

msgid "e.g. %H: "
msgstr "eż. %H: "

msgid ""
"Session output is appended as plain text while connected. %S expands to the "
"session name, %H to the hostname, %Y %M %D to the date and %h %m %s to the "
"time (of connecting, in the file name; of writing, in the texts above). A "
"log named with the date starts a new file at midnight."
msgstr "L-output tas-sessjoni jiżdied bħala test sempliċi waqt il-konnessjoni. %S jinbidel fl-isem tas-sessjoni, %H fl-isem tal-host, %Y %M %D fid-data u %h %m %s fil-ħin (tal-konnessjoni, fl-isem tal-fajl; tal-kitba, fit-testi ta' hawn fuq). Log li jismu fih id-data jibda fajl ġdid f'nofsillejl."

msgid ""
"A VNC desktop is the size the server sets: shown whole, scaled down when the "
"tab is smaller, or with Scale to window stretched to fill the tab. "
"Connection speed sets the picture quality; the other settings here are for "
"RDP sessions. VNC is not encrypted: set a jump host (Connection page) to "
"tunnel it through SSH."
msgstr "Desktop VNC għandu d-daqs li jissettja s-server: jidher sħiħ, imċekken meta t-tab ikun iżgħar, jew, b'Skala għat-tieqa, imġebbed biex jimla t-tab. Il-veloċità tal-konnessjoni tissettja l-kwalità tal-istampa; l-issettjar l-ieħor hawnhekk huwa għal sessjonijiet RDP. VNC mhuwiex ikkriptjat: issettja host intermedju (paġna Konnessjoni) biex tgħaddih minn mina SSH."

msgid "These settings are for RDP sessions."
msgstr "Dan l-issettjar huwa għal sessjonijiet RDP."

msgid "Desktop size:"
msgstr "Daqs tad-desktop:"

msgid "width"
msgstr "wisa'"

msgid "x"
msgstr "x"

msgid "height"
msgstr "għoli"

msgid "Scale to window"
msgstr "Skala għat-tieqa"

msgid ""
"Blank: the remote desktop follows the tab's size. A fixed size (in pixels) "
"stays the same whatever the window does: shown whole, scaled down when the "
"tab is smaller, or with Scale to window stretched to fill the tab."
msgstr "Vojt: id-desktop remot isegwi d-daqs tat-tab. Daqs fiss (f'pixels) jibqa' l-istess tagħmel x'tagħmel it-tieqa: jidher sħiħ, imċekken meta t-tab ikun iżgħar, jew, b'Skala għat-tieqa, imġebbed biex jimla t-tab."

msgid "Connection speed:"
msgstr "Veloċità tal-konnessjoni:"

msgid "Best quality: lossless (fast network)"
msgstr "L-aħjar kwalità: mingħajr telf (netwerk mgħaġġel)"

msgid "Balanced: photos and video as JPEG"
msgstr "Bilanċjat: ritratti u video bħala JPEG"

msgid "Fastest: lower JPEG quality (slow links)"
msgstr "L-aktar mgħaġġel: kwalità JPEG aktar baxxa (konnessjonijiet bil-mod)"

msgid "Best appearance (fast network)"
msgstr "L-aħjar dehra (netwerk mgħaġġel)"

msgid "Balanced: no wallpaper or animations"
msgstr "Bilanċjat: bla wallpaper jew animazzjonijiet"

msgid "Fastest: no visual effects (slow links)"
msgstr "L-aktar mgħaġġel: bla effetti viżivi (konnessjonijiet bil-mod)"

msgid ""
"VNC servers with the Tight encoding (TightVNC, TigerVNC, x11vnc) send "
"pictures and video as JPEG when this is Balanced or Fastest; text and flat "
"areas stay exact. Others always send the exact picture."
msgstr "Servers VNC bil-kodifika Tight (TightVNC, TigerVNC, x11vnc) jibagħtu stampi u video bħala JPEG meta dan ikun Bilanċjat jew L-aktar mgħaġġel; it-test u l-erjas lixxi jibqgħu eżatti. Oħrajn dejjem jibagħtu l-istampa eżatta."

msgid ""
"The less the server draws, the less it sends: leaving out the wallpaper and "
"animations makes the desktop noticeably quicker over the internet or a VPN."
msgstr "Iktar ma s-server ipinġi inqas, inqas jibgħat: jekk tħalli barra l-wallpaper u l-animazzjonijiet, id-desktop isir notevolment aktar mgħaġġel fuq l-internet jew VPN."

msgid ""
"Use H.264 when the server offers it (much faster; turn off if the desktop "
"stays black)"
msgstr "Uża H.264 meta s-server joffrih (ħafna aktar mgħaġġel; itfih jekk id-desktop jibqa' iswed)"

msgid "Connect to the console (administrative) session, like mstsc /admin"
msgstr "Qabbad mas-sessjoni tal-konsola (amministrattiva), bħal mstsc /admin"

msgid "Play the remote computer's sound on this computer"
msgstr "Daqq il-ħoss tal-kompjuter remot fuq dan il-kompjuter"

msgid "Share a local folder:"
msgstr "Aqsam folder lokali:"

msgid "none"
msgstr "xejn"

msgid ""
"The folder appears on the remote computer as a drive (under This PC), named "
"after the folder: copy files to and from it there. The remote computer can "
"read, change and delete everything in it."
msgstr "Il-folder jidher fuq il-kompjuter remot bħala drajv (taħt This PC), bl-isem tal-folder: ikkopja fajls lejh u minnu hemmhekk. Il-kompjuter remot jista' jaqra, ibiddel u jħassar kull ma fih."

msgid ""
"Keys mapped for this session (tried before Global Options > Keyboard), one "
"per line:"
msgstr "Tasti mmappjati għal din is-sessjoni (ippruvati qabel Għażliet Globali > Tastiera), wieħed f'kull linja:"

msgid ""
"Key = what it does. Keys: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, "
"Enter, Escape, Space or a character, with Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (characters need "
"Ctrl or Alt). Text is sent (\\r is Enter); or script: file, menu: command, "
"run: program, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."
msgstr "Tasta = x'tagħmel. Tasti: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, Enter, Escape, Space jew karattru, ma' Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (il-karattri jeħtieġu Ctrl jew Alt). It-test jintbagħat (\\r huwa Enter); jew script: fajl, menu: kmand, run: programm, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."

msgid "Script file:"
msgstr "Fajl tal-iskript:"

msgid "blank for none"
msgstr "vojt għal xejn"

msgid "Or write the script here (used when no file is set):"
msgstr "Jew ikteb l-iskript hawn (jintuża meta ma jkun issettjat l-ebda fajl):"

msgid ""
"Runs each time the session connects. A .rhai file runs as a Rhai script and "
"a .py file as a SecureCRT Python script (see the README). Otherwise one "
"command per line: wait <text> (for the host to print it), send <text> (\\r "
"is Enter), sleep <ms>, timeout <s> (for later waits; default 30), # comment."
